<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-FREE STATE 292-2 AT LUNCH VS W.PROVINCE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-FREE STATE 292-2 AT LUNCH VS W.PROVINCE.</headline>
<dateline>BLOEMFONTEIN 1996-12-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Free State were 292 for two at lunch on the final day of the Supersport Series match against Western Province at Springbok Park.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>Western Province 446</p>
<p>Free State 280 and 292 for two (Gerrie Liebenberg 91, Deon Jordaan 80, Boeta Dippenaar 58 not out, Louis Wilkinson 47 not out).</p>
</text>
